# Cloudflare Pages / Netlify: every page of the site is a pre-rendered file
# (dist/mystery.html is served at /mystery, see scripts/prerender.mjs), so no
# address needs rewriting. Anything else falls through to a real 404 (404.html),
# so a script from an old build fails cleanly and the app reloads into the new
# one instead of receiving the home page in its place.
